# OpenProject - non-secret config. Committed.
# OP_DB_PASSWORD and OP_SECRET_KEY_BASE are NOT here. They are Komodo
# Variables marked Secret and arrive via komodo.env - see the entry in
# komodo/resources/stacks.toml.

# --- Version ---
# Major version only. auto_update is OFF for this stack, same as Immich,
# because OpenProject runs database migrations on version bumps. Deploy a new
# major by hand, after reading the release notes and after a fresh backup.
OPENPROJECT_VERSION=17

# --- Storage ---
# Everything this stack writes lives on the work disk, not on CONFIG_ROOT.
# This deviates from the "databases on CONFIG_ROOT" convention in common.env
# on purpose: the database holds client records, and client data stays on
# its own mount. See docs/WORK.md.
WORK_ROOT=/mnt/work
